 <div class=\"brand\">Mozilla<br>Support</div>\n      <nav class=\"nav\">\n        <span>Explore Help Articles</span>\n        <span>Community Forums</span>\n        <span>Ask a Question</span>\n        <span>Contribute</span>\n      </nav>\n      <button class=\"signin\">Sign In/Up</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <main class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"breadcrumb\"><span>Home</span> / <span>Firefox</span> / Privacy and security</div>\n\n      <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"firefox-mark\" aria-label=\"Firefox logo\"></div>\n        <div class=\"download-area\">\n          <button class=\"download\">Download Firefox</button>\n          <div class=\"tiny-links\">\n            <a>Systems and Languages</a>\n            <a>What's New</a>\n            <a>Privacy</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Privacy and security</h1>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\">Learn how to protect your privacy and secure your data.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"tabs\">\n        <div class=\"tab active\">All articles and threads</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\">Tracking protection</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\">Encryption</div>\n        <div class=\"tab\">Security</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"article-list\">\n        <article class=\"article\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Use built-in VPN in Firefox</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">Learn how to activate and use the built-in VPN feature in Firefox to protect your browsing.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 1 day ago</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Common Myths about Private Browsing</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">Learn more about common misconceptions about Private Browsing in Firefox.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 11/3/25</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article long\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Avoid and report Mozilla tech support scams</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">Mozilla does not provide telephone support and does not charge for software downloads, upgrades or<br>technical help. Learn more.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox, Firefox for Android, Firefox for iOS,...</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 2/3/25</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article long\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Insecure connection password warning in Firefox</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">Firefox will show you a \"connection is not secure\" warning message when a website login page is<br>insecure and information could be stolen.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 3/19/26</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article long\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Third-party trackers</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">Learn about cross-site (third-party) cookies that collect information to track your browsing, which are<br>used on many websites.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 10/26/24</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article long\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Does Firefox share my location with websites?</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">Learn what information Firefox sends to websites about your location and how to use and manage<br>location-aware features of your browser.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 3/22/26</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article long\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Configure DNS over HTTPS protection levels in Firefox</h3>\n          <p class=\"article-description\">DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is a recommended feature that enhances privacy. Learn more about the DoH<br>protection levels you can configure in Firefox settings.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\"><span class=\"product\">Firefox</span><span class=\"pencil\">✎</span><span class=\"updated\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 3/27/25</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article compact\">\n          <span class=\"article-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\">Enhanced Tracking Protection in Firefox for desktop</h3>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"search\">\n        <span>Search questions, articles,</span>\n        <i class=\"magnifier\"></i>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>Popular Firefox Topics</h2>\n      <ul class=\"topics\">\n        <li class=\"double\">Backup, recovery, and<br>sync</li>\n        <li>Browse</li>\n        <li class=\"double\">Performance and<br>connectivity</li>\n        <li>Accessibility</li>\n        <li>Download and save</li>\n        <li>Search, ta